name 'building-data-driven-systems-postassessment-q11_2025'

question 'How can "Data Labels" in a UI influence a user\'s trust in an AI-driven system?'

wrong 'Labels make the text look more professional.'
right 'Accurate and descriptive labels help the user verify that the AI is processing the correct data.'
wrong 'Labels prevent the user from seeing the actual data values.'
wrong 'Labels are only used to satisfy legal requirements and do not affect trust.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 7

Transparency is key to trust. By clearly labeling data (e.g., "AI Confidence Score: 95%"), users can better interpret the system's outputs.
MARKDOWN
